cartridge "FIREFLY LAKE/AMY & CLAUDE/2026"

' FIREFLY LAKE (v2) - an original ColecoVision pinball. Amy & Claude 2026,
' written in Amy with Amy Studio (r12.11, optimizer profile balanced), on a
' standard 32 KB cartridge. Built by build.py from this file, table.py
' (the table), physgen.py (the physics tables), engine.asm (the ball),
' lib.asm (the VDP helpers), art.py (the pictures), music/*.txt.
'
' A summer night by a lake in the forest. Light the seven letters of
' FIREFLY to call the SWARM: 20 seconds when the pop bumpers are worth ten
' times as much and the ramp scores a jackpot. 55 lamps, each with a rule:
' skill-shot arrows, five top lanes (multiplier 2X-5X), orbit arrows (left:
' a letter, right: lights the spinner), standups (light the outlane saves),
' drop targets (light EXTRA BALL on the ramp), the bonus ring, the inlane
' combo, SHOOT AGAIN (ball save).
'   left button: left flipper, right button: right flipper
'   stick down: pull the plunger, let go to launch
'   stick left / right / up: nudge the table (too much: TILT)

